version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
repository-code: "https://github.com/VentiMath/hurwitz-lattice"
url: "https://github.com/VentiMath/hurwitz-lattice/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic verification of the degree-six Brown-Peterson coefficient
  calculation in Appendix B of The Hurwitz Lattice and the Two-Slice of
  Quaternionic Real Bordism. Checks integral quaternionic actions, mod-two
  fixed vectors, two integral identities, the six-by-six coefficient
  certificate, and the determinant of a two-local orbit basis.
